\section{Coefficient interpretation}{

\code{lambda} is the endogenous peer-effect coefficient. Coefficients named for
variables in \code{own_vars} are own effects. Coefficients prefixed by \code{ave_} are
effects of the corresponding peer averages from \code{peer_vars}.
}

